{"title":"2025 IOQM/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Problem_Statement_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.B6.E0.B5.8D.E0.B4.A8.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B5.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.A3.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_Statement_പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem Statement പ്രശ്നവിവരണം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider a fraction <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bde3a598eeda3249465599773ab4e79154e3182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b} \\neq \\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"53\" height=\"38\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive integers with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a964dc4456ed42fcc8c54c7d4054fd8c79ceb890.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,b) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/9/75965113f59a1516a2e822aa2c6baa0863d7620a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b \\leq 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />. If this fraction is chosen closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" /> amongst all such fractions then what is the smallest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/4/404f47dd26f9d5edc7966e823def7df0252a6349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}\\neq\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"53\" height=\"38\" /> ആയ ഒരു ഭിന്നസംഖ്യ പരിഗണിക്കുക. ഇവിടെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> ധനപൂർണ്ണസംഖ്യകളാണ്, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb04971aa1521dca22b49b27b1c7c026accd676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,b)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />, കൂടാതെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/79710cad33346413df59b1dea1da241ac275aaa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\leq15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" /> ആണ്. ഇത്തരത്തിലുള്ള എല്ലാ ഭിന്നസംഖ്യകളിൽ നിന്ന് <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/1/e1150a17bf1b733cb666be84d920c71fc96bb3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />-ന് ഏറ്റവും അടുത്തുള്ള ഭിന്നസംഖ്യ തിരഞ്ഞെടുക്കുമ്പോൾ, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />-ന്റെ ഏറ്റവും ചെറിയ മൂല്യം എന്താണ്?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_.E0.B4.AA.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.BF.E0.B4.B9.E0.B4.BE.E0.B4.B0.E0.B4.82\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_പരിഹാരം\">Solution പരിഹാരം</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IOQM/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution പരിഹാരം\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We require <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084079bf1d54500f3c59257a7ec3467932b72ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" /> closest to 0.75. That is, we require <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/d/bed8e5fcc7eedc838f2116d3ecb9a781672e61cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left|{}\\frac{a}{b}-\\frac{3}{4}\\right|{}=\\frac{|{}4a-3b|{}}{4b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"162\" height=\"45\" /> to be minimal. The numerator cannot be equal to 0, hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/b/99b20fd51bd295618399b780f79c3813821f1dd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|4a-3b| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" />. To make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08ce40d08bd53d0e29bfeedd4e55132a2f924a96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"23\" height=\"38\" /> as small as possible we require <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a6aa26a4e9a9b876542cbb2eeb050fcfe690e35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> to be maximized hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e8424543947bec329fba56e2b5e9226ad42c4567.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b =15 \\implies 4b = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"161\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b3ab9e0989091d774e26edd31eb6d11bce519e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a = 46 \\implies a &lt; 11.5, 4a = 44 \\implies a \\geq 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />. Indeed, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/6/ae6b76fe12eefdedbf582848c722f91181b5f595.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34e5f91de9daf5d4420fab8537bbe9377e312200.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> works. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/f/54fc896cf144a170b0b6cad5ae2bf85fb84b7282.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"31\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/084079bf1d54500f3c59257a7ec3467932b72ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"34\" />-യെ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/274c3ed420a60124420c39b147c9a39b6778d0f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.75$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />-ന് ഏറ്റവും അടുത്തതാക്കണം. അതായത്, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/8/7a88c5a51209480a36283595ef32d9ffabc9d605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left|\\frac{a}{b}-\\frac{3}{4}\\right|=\\frac{|4a-3b|}{4b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"159\" height=\"45\" /> ഏറ്റവും കുറഞ്ഞതായിരിക്കണം.\n</p><p>ന്യൂമറേറ്റർ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> ആകാൻ പാടില്ല. അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/5/ba5b014d72e7c74fa9f20b39a928ad80bfd6bb9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|4a-3b|=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/c/08ce40d08bd53d0e29bfeedd4e55132a2f924a96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"23\" height=\"38\" /> കഴിയുന്നത്ര ചെറുതാക്കാൻ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a6aa26a4e9a9b876542cbb2eeb050fcfe690e35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> കഴിയുന്നത്ര വലുതായിരിക്കണം. അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e135c0e3b59993e60f8ecda3ec04295dfd58ed82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=15\\implies4b=60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"161\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>അതിനാൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/f/f2f70f4f21776371d5a6598e5923c3d2c49f6476.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a=46\\implies a&lt;11.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/e/83e071ea7f9354f05b3a9748b769b0bbb7892fd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a=44\\implies a\\geq11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"164\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>തീർച്ചയായും, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/3867a5832ef0c48a7a8666d9a63100c86146632d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> ആണെങ്കിൽ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/6/416e6a0025cce87f93c9004a25dc990967366204.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" /> സാധുവാണ്.\n</p><p>ഉത്തരം <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/f/54fc896cf144a170b0b6cad5ae2bf85fb84b7282.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"31\" height=\"25\" /> ആണ്.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070500\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.027 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 139/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6608/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37888:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070500 and revision id 292626. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}